# tab, the word, a tab, what the entry said, a tab, and why. The build does
# not read this. It is the record that keeps a word out: a later change the
# community makes to one of these words is reported by
# tools/measure/dictgate.py rather than taken, and
# tools/measure/published.py proposes nothing for them. Published means
# Merriam-Webster's first-listed form for an ordinary word, the person's or
# the place's own for a name, and Wiktionary or the CMU Pronouncing
# Dictionary where nothing better has the word; CMU supports the rules is
